*  frame_cross_blob_alt - backtrack must CROSS a blob boundary: *Q exhausts, the
*  retry belongs to *P's interior ALT.  s124 beauty-residue item 2 (the '*Parse
*  *Space' nesting at beauty.sno:614) reduced, no ARBNO required.
*  ⛔ v1 of this witness used P=('x'|'xy') literals-only: sno_pat_inline_ok folds
*  that INLINE, no blob is ever minted, and it passed while exercising NOTHING
*  (the s122 exoneration trap).  The deferred alternate *A2 (manual p.86) defeats
*  the fold so P is a real blob.
*  Oracle trace on 'xyyz': P='x', Q fails both arms at 'yyz'; re-enter P => 'xy';
*  Q at 'yz' takes 'yz'; RPOS(0) => MATCH.
        A2 = 'xy'
        P = ('x' | *A2)
        Q = ('z' | 'yz')
        s = 'xyyz'
        s POS(0) *P *Q RPOS(0)                                :S(G)F(B)
G       OUTPUT = 'match'                                      :(END)
B       OUTPUT = 'nomatch'
END
